		getimagesize( $uploaded_tmp ) ) {
		if( !move_uploaded_file( $uploaded_tmp, $target_path ) ) {", "source": "multipart/form-data 上传字段 `uploaded` 的文件名与内容", "source_kind": "upload", "source_name": "uploaded", "tainted_expression": "$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] / $_FILES['uploaded']['tmp_name']", "sink": "move_uploaded_file($uploaded_tmp, $target_path) 写入 web 可访问目录 hackable/uploads/", "endpoint": "/043.php", "http_method": "POST", "exploit_chain": [{"step": 1, "location": "043.php:3", "description": "检测到 POST 参数 Upload 即进入上传处理分支", "data_state": "攻击者控制 multipart 请求"}, {"step": 2, "location": "043.php:9-12", "description": "从 $_FILES['uploaded'] 读取文件名、扩展名、大小、临时路径", "data_state": "文件名与内容完全由攻击者控制"}, {"step": 3, "location": "043.php:15-17", "description": "校验扩展名属于 jpg/jpeg/png、大小 <100000、getimagesize 为真", "data_state": "扩展名白名单通过；getimagesize 仅校验文件头，图片尾部附加 PHP 代码仍返回真", "bypass_reason": "getimagesize 只解析图片头，不检测尾部附加内容；扩展名取自文件名最后一段，攻击者可将文件命名为 shell.php.png 或 shell.png 并在尾部写入 <?php ... ?>"}, {"step": 4, "location": "043.php:5-6", "description": "用 basename(文件名) 拼接目标路径 hackable/uploads/", "data_state": "目标路径 = web 根下可访问目录 + 攻击者文件名"}, {"step": 5, "location": "043.php:20", "description": "move_uploaded_file 将临时文件移动到目标路径", "data_state": "恶意图片马落盘到 web 可访问目录"}, {"step": 6, "location": "043.php:26", "description": "响应回显上传后的完整路径，攻击者据此定位文件 URL", "data_state": "泄露落盘路径，便于后续访问触发"}], "poc": {"description": "构造一个合法 PNG 头 + 尾部 PHP 代码的图片马，通过 multipart 上传，随后访问上传文件触发 PHP 执行。仅限授权测试。", "preconditions": ["目标为 DVWA 默认部署，hackable/uploads/ 位于 web 根且可被 PHP 解析", "攻击者可访问 /043.php 与上传目录"], "steps": [{"step": 1, "action": "上传图片马（文件头为 PNG 魔数，尾部附加 PHP 代码），文件名为 shell.png", "request": "POST /043.php HTTP/1.1
